{"repositoryId":730456655,"availability":"available","full":"Yelison/Yelison.github.io","name":"Yelison.github.io","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2023-12-12T01:02:47Z","updated":"2026-10-13T06:29:47Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yelison.github.io/","topics":[],"demo":"https://yelison.github.io/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:31.300Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:31.300Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:31.300Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T06:39:31.300Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A portfolio that builds itself in front of the visitor. A terminal opens, and the real source code of the page is typed into an iframe while borders are drawn, letters glow and each section appears. Visitors can skip the animation, switch between English and Spanish, toggle a light or dark theme, try a live project demo, or type destroy to watch the page fall apart and build it again.","The site is HTML, CSS and JavaScript with no framework. A small Node.js build step assembles it from partials and data."],"features":["Live build engine. index.html streams live-source.json into an iframe with","document.write. The typing speed adapts so every phase lasts a fixed time, and the iframe scrolls to follow the code being written. Borders are traced with SVG, and new letters glow using the CSS Custom Highlight API.","One source of truth. The same ordered list of phases","(src/live-build/phases.js) produces the static portfolio.html and the live build, so the two can never drift apart.","Build-time i18n. Markup is written in English and annotated with data-i"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yelison/Yelison.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"75d1875fdda8ba62e72ab80b9bc928ca31d6beb85e564150182249e14dc53205","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:31.539Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026